        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "285. Regular employees may be discharged without recourse to the grievance procedure within the first ninety (90) days of employment. Short Hour, Casual and Temporary employees may be discharged without recourse to the grievance procedure within the first three hundred (300) hours or ninety (90) days whichever is later.",
            "block_bbox": [
