        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "287. Both the Employer and the Union pledge their active, aggressive and continuing efforts to secure prompt disposition of requests, complaints and grievances; and agree that most disputes can be, should be and will be resolved in the oral discussions. In the few cases where such is not accomplished, the following procedure shall apply.\nSection 5 - Grievance Procedure",
