            "block_content": "288. The first step of a grievance, as defined in Section 3 above, shall be the discussion with the Department Head by the employee, Field Representative and/or Shop Steward. Every grievance must be initiated in the first step within thirty (30) working days after occurrence of the event causing the grievance or",
